Third-party lineage
--------------------

The LAN RoboVac client under `custom_components/robovac_legacy/lan/` ports keying,
command framing, and protobuf-derived wire layout from archived **PyRobovac**
(`https://pypi.org/project/robovac/` 0.0.9 lineage), itself tracing to Google's
Apache-2.0 **python-lakeside** (`https://github.com/google/python-lakeside`).
The integration vendors that behavior so protobuf stubs track Home Assistant Core.

Home Assistant merges `requirements` constraints (including `protobuf`); this
fork keeps regenerated `*_pb2` files beside `LocalServerInfo.proto`.
